SmartSessionERC7739::nestedTypeFuzz
└── given a random acyclic graph of 2 to 5 struct types with the primary type enabled
    ├── when the primary type's struct is signed by the session key
    │   └── it never reverts and returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
    └── when another type of the graph is presented under the enabled or its own description
        └── it never reverts and returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
